IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `s121-nouns`
IMPORT `s121-support`
IMPORT `s121-d1-special`

-- Tests for subsections (d)(1) to (d)(8). Expected values are worked out by hand from the text and the calendar.

§ `Tests: (d)(1) to (d)(8)`

-- (d)(1): joint return, either spouse
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(1) subsections (a) and (c) apply to the joint return` TRUE (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(1) subsections (a) and (c) apply to the joint return` TRUE (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(1) subsections (a) and (c) apply to the joint return` TRUE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(1) subsections (a) and (c) apply to the joint return` TRUE (JUST FALSE) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(1) subsections (a) and (c) apply to the joint return` FALSE (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING

-- (d)(2): a spouse who died on 1 July 2024 owned 1 January 2020 to 31 December 2024 (the part before death is 1 January 2020 to 30 June 2024)
`a test span of the late spouse` MEANS LIST Span OF (Date 1 1 2020), (Date 31 12 2024)
`a test span of the late spouse clipped` MEANS LIST Span OF (Date 1 1 2020), (Date 30 6 2024)
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(2) the periods the deceased spouse owned the property before death are included` TRUE `a test span of the late spouse` (Date 1 7 2024) EQUALS JUST `a test span of the late spouse clipped`
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(2) the periods the deceased spouse used the property before death are included` TRUE `a test span of the late spouse` (Date 1 7 2024) EQUALS JUST `a test span of the late spouse clipped`
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(2) the periods the deceased spouse owned the property before death are included` FALSE `a test span of the late spouse` (Date 1 7 2024) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(2) the periods the deceased spouse used the property before death are included` FALSE `a test span of the late spouse` (Date 1 7 2024) EQUALS NOTHING
-- a period that begins on the day of death is not "before death"
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(2) the periods the deceased spouse owned the property before death are included` TRUE (LIST Span OF (Date 1 7 2024), (Date 31 12 2024)) (Date 1 7 2024) EQUALS JUST EMPTY

-- (d)(3)(A)
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(3)(A) the period the transferor owned the property is included` TRUE `a test span of the late spouse` EQUALS JUST `a test span of the late spouse`
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(3)(A) the period the transferor owned the property is included` FALSE `a test span of the late spouse` EQUALS NOTHING

-- (d)(3)(C): the instrument. Four facts: decree of divorce or separate maintenance, incident instrument, separation agreement, support decree.
`a test decree` MEANS Instrument WITH `a decree of divorce or separate maintenance` IS TRUE, `a written instrument incident to such a decree` IS FALSE, `a written separation agreement` IS FALSE, `a decree requiring a spouse to make payments for the support or maintenance of the other spouse` IS FALSE
`a test incident instrument` MEANS Instrument WITH `a decree of divorce or separate maintenance` IS FALSE, `a written instrument incident to such a decree` IS TRUE, `a written separation agreement` IS FALSE, `a decree requiring a spouse to make payments for the support or maintenance of the other spouse` IS FALSE
`a test separation agreement` MEANS Instrument WITH `a decree of divorce or separate maintenance` IS FALSE, `a written instrument incident to such a decree` IS FALSE, `a written separation agreement` IS TRUE, `a decree requiring a spouse to make payments for the support or maintenance of the other spouse` IS FALSE
`a test support decree` MEANS Instrument WITH `a decree of divorce or separate maintenance` IS FALSE, `a written instrument incident to such a decree` IS FALSE, `a written separation agreement` IS FALSE, `a decree requiring a spouse to make payments for the support or maintenance of the other spouse` IS TRUE
`a test divorce decree that also requires support` MEANS Instrument WITH `a decree of divorce or separate maintenance` IS TRUE, `a written instrument incident to such a decree` IS FALSE, `a written separation agreement` IS FALSE, `a decree requiring a spouse to make payments for the support or maintenance of the other spouse` IS TRUE
`a test no instrument` MEANS Instrument WITH `a decree of divorce or separate maintenance` IS FALSE, `a written instrument incident to such a decree` IS FALSE, `a written separation agreement` IS FALSE, `a decree requiring a spouse to make payments for the support or maintenance of the other spouse` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(3)(C)(i) the instrument is a decree of divorce or separate maintenance or a written instrument incident to such a decree` `a test decree`
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(3)(C)(i) the instrument is a decree of divorce or separate maintenance or a written instrument incident to such a decree` `a test incident instrument`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 121(d)(3)(C)(i) the instrument is a decree of divorce or separate maintenance or a written instrument incident to such a decree` `a test separation agreement`)
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(3)(C)(ii) the instrument is a written separation agreement` `a test separation agreement`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 121(d)(3)(C)(ii) the instrument is a written separation agreement` `a test decree`)
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(3)(C)(iii) the instrument is a decree not described in clause (i) requiring support payments` `a test support decree`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 121(d)(3)(C)(iii) the instrument is a decree not described in clause (i) requiring support payments` `a test divorce decree that also requires support`)
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(3)(C) the instrument is a divorce or separation instrument` `a test decree` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(3)(C) the instrument is a divorce or separation instrument` `a test incident instrument` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(3)(C) the instrument is a divorce or separation instrument` `a test separation agreement` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(3)(C) the instrument is a divorce or separation instrument` `a test support decree` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(3)(C) the instrument is a divorce or separation instrument` `a test divorce decree that also requires support` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(3)(C) the instrument is a divorce or separation instrument` `a test no instrument` EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- (d)(3)(B): owned 1 January 2018 to 31 December 2024; use granted 1 June 2021 to 31 May 2022 under a decree
`a test ownership 2018 to 2024` MEANS LIST Span OF (Date 1 1 2018), (Date 31 12 2024)
`a test grant under a decree` MEANS `Use granted` WITH
    `days` IS (Span OF (Date 1 6 2021), (Date 31 5 2022))
    `instrument` IS `a test decree`
`a test grant under nothing` MEANS `Use granted` WITH
    `days` IS (Span OF (Date 1 6 2021), (Date 31 5 2022))
    `instrument` IS `a test no instrument`
`a test grant before ownership began` MEANS `Use granted` WITH
    `days` IS (Span OF (Date 1 6 2017), (Date 30 6 2018))
    `instrument` IS `a test separation agreement`
`a test one grant` MEANS LIST `a test grant under a decree`
`a test grant of no instrument` MEANS LIST `a test grant under nothing`
`a test grant straddling the start` MEANS LIST `a test grant before ownership began`
`a test deemed use in 2021 to 2022` MEANS LIST Span OF (Date 1 6 2021), (Date 31 5 2022)
`a test deemed use in 2018` MEANS LIST Span OF (Date 1 1 2018), (Date 30 6 2018)
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(3)(B) the individual is treated as using the property as the principal residence while a spouse or former spouse is granted use` `a test ownership 2018 to 2024` `a test one grant` EQUALS JUST `a test deemed use in 2021 to 2022`
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(3)(B) the individual is treated as using the property as the principal residence while a spouse or former spouse is granted use` `a test ownership 2018 to 2024` `a test grant of no instrument` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(3)(B) the individual is treated as using the property as the principal residence while a spouse or former spouse is granted use` `a test ownership 2018 to 2024` EMPTY EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(3)(B) the individual is treated as using the property as the principal residence while a spouse or former spouse is granted use` `a test ownership 2018 to 2024` `a test grant straddling the start` EQUALS JUST `a test deemed use in 2018`

-- (d)(4): the cooperative
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(4)(A) the holding requirement is applied to the holding of the stock` TRUE `a test ownership 2018 to 2024` EQUALS JUST `a test ownership 2018 to 2024`
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(4)(A) the holding requirement is applied to the holding of the stock` FALSE `a test ownership 2018 to 2024` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(4)(B) the use requirement is applied to the house or apartment the taxpayer was entitled to occupy` TRUE `a test ownership 2018 to 2024` EQUALS JUST `a test ownership 2018 to 2024`
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(4)(B) the use requirement is applied to the house or apartment the taxpayer was entitled to occupy` FALSE `a test ownership 2018 to 2024` EQUALS NOTHING

-- (d)(5): the events
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(5)(A) the event is treated as the sale of the property` `destruction` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(5)(A) the event is treated as the sale of the property` `theft` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(5)(A) the event is treated as the sale of the property` `seizure` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(5)(A) the event is treated as the sale of the property` `requisition` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(5)(A) the event is treated as the sale of the property` `condemnation` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(5)(A) the event is treated as the sale of the property` `sale or exchange` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(5)(A) the event is treated as the sale of the property` `some other event` EQUALS NOTHING
-- (d)(5)(B): 1,000,000 determined without regard to this section, less 250,000 not included in gross income
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(5)(B) the amount realized in applying section 1033` 1000000 250000 EQUALS 750000
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(5)(B) the amount realized in applying section 1033` 200000 0 EQUALS 200000
`a test converted holding` MEANS Holding OF `a test ownership 2018 to 2024`, `a test deemed use in 2018`
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(5)(C) the holding and use of the converted property are treated as holding and use of the property sold` TRUE `a test converted holding` EQUALS JUST `a test converted holding`
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(5)(C) the holding and use of the converted property are treated as holding and use of the property sold` FALSE `a test converted holding` EQUALS NOTHING

-- (d)(6): adjustments attributable to periods after May 6, 1997
`an adjustment on 7 May 1997 only` MEANS `Depreciation adjustment` WITH
    `amount` IS 8000
    `period it is attributable to` IS (Span OF (Date 7 5 1997), (Date 7 5 1997))
`an adjustment on 6 May 1997 only` MEANS `Depreciation adjustment` WITH
    `amount` IS 5000
    `period it is attributable to` IS (Span OF (Date 6 5 1997), (Date 6 5 1997))
`an adjustment in 1996` MEANS `Depreciation adjustment` WITH
    `amount` IS 4000
    `period it is attributable to` IS (Span OF (Date 1 1 1996), (Date 31 12 1996))
`an adjustment across May 6 1997` MEANS `Depreciation adjustment` WITH
    `amount` IS 3000
    `period it is attributable to` IS (Span OF (Date 1 1 1997), (Date 31 12 1997))
`an adjustment in 2010` MEANS `Depreciation adjustment` WITH
    `amount` IS 2000
    `period it is attributable to` IS (Span OF (Date 1 1 2010), (Date 31 12 2010))
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(6) the gain to which subsection (a) shall not apply` 20000 (LIST `an adjustment on 7 May 1997 only`) EQUALS JUST 8000
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(6) the gain to which subsection (a) shall not apply` 20000 (LIST `an adjustment on 6 May 1997 only`) EQUALS JUST 0
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(6) the gain to which subsection (a) shall not apply` 20000 (LIST `an adjustment in 1996`) EQUALS JUST 0
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(6) the gain to which subsection (a) shall not apply` 20000 (LIST `an adjustment across May 6 1997`) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(6) the gain to which subsection (a) shall not apply` 20000 (LIST `an adjustment in 2010`, `an adjustment on 7 May 1997 only`) EQUALS JUST 10000
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(6) the gain to which subsection (a) shall not apply` 5000 (LIST `an adjustment in 2010`, `an adjustment on 7 May 1997 only`) EQUALS JUST 5000
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(6) the gain to which subsection (a) shall not apply` 10000 (LIST `an adjustment in 2010`, `an adjustment on 7 May 1997 only`) EQUALS JUST 10000
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(6) the gain to which subsection (a) shall not apply` 20000 EMPTY EQUALS JUST 0

-- (d)(7): sale on 15 March 2026; window 16 March 2021 to 15 March 2026; 1 year ending on the sale date is 365 days (16 March 2025 to 15 March 2026)
`a test window for the care case` MEANS Span OF (Date 16 3 2021), (Date 15 3 2026)
`a test owner of a year` MEANS Holding OF (LIST Span OF (Date 1 1 2015), (Date 15 3 2026)), (LIST Span OF (Date 16 3 2025), (Date 15 3 2026))
`a test owner of 364 days` MEANS Holding OF (LIST Span OF (Date 1 1 2015), (Date 15 3 2026)), (LIST Span OF (Date 17 3 2025), (Date 15 3 2026))
`a test licensed stay` MEANS LIST (`Stay in a facility` WITH
    `days` IS (Span OF (Date 1 9 2025), (Date 15 3 2026))
    `facility licensed by a State or political subdivision to care for an individual in the taxpayer's condition` IS TRUE)
`a test unlicensed stay` MEANS LIST (`Stay in a facility` WITH
    `days` IS (Span OF (Date 1 9 2025), (Date 15 3 2026))
    `facility licensed by a State or political subdivision to care for an individual in the taxpayer's condition` IS FALSE)
`a test deemed use from September 2025` MEANS LIST Span OF (Date 1 9 2025), (Date 15 3 2026)
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(7) the taxpayer is treated as using the property as the principal residence while residing in a licensed facility` TRUE `a test owner of a year` `a test window for the care case` (Date 15 3 2026) `a test licensed stay` EQUALS JUST `a test deemed use from September 2025`
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(7) the taxpayer is treated as using the property as the principal residence while residing in a licensed facility` TRUE `a test owner of a year` `a test window for the care case` (Date 15 3 2026) `a test unlicensed stay` EQUALS JUST EMPTY
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(7) the taxpayer is treated as using the property as the principal residence while residing in a licensed facility` TRUE `a test owner of 364 days` `a test window for the care case` (Date 15 3 2026) `a test licensed stay` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(7) the taxpayer is treated as using the property as the principal residence while residing in a licensed facility` FALSE `a test owner of a year` `a test window for the care case` (Date 15 3 2026) `a test licensed stay` EQUALS NOTHING

-- (d)(8): remainder interests
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(8)(A) this section does not fail to apply to the sale of the interest by reason of its being a remainder interest` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(8)(A) this section does not fail to apply to the sale of the interest by reason of its being a remainder interest` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(8)(A) this section does not fail to apply to the sale of the interest by reason of its being a remainder interest` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(8)(A) this section does not fail to apply to the sale of the interest by reason of its being a remainder interest` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(8)(B) subparagraph (A) applies to the sale` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 121(d)(8)(B) subparagraph (A) applies to the sale` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
